# DATE keys (EventDate read as DATE through the clickbench option).
query TI rowsort
SELECT EventDate, COUNT(*) FROM hits_like WHERE EventDate < DATE '2013-07-05' GROUP BY EventDate
----
2013-07-01	353
2013-07-02	362
2013-07-03	350
2013-07-04	311

# A FLOAT column groups -0.0 with 0.0 (only counts are compared: FLOAT results are DOUBLE, D11).
